# Literal translation: and some of them evil war and terrible battle-cry—some indeed at seven-gated Thebes, in the Cadmean land, destroyed fighting over the flocks of Oedipus, and others also in ships over the great gulf of the sea leading to Troy for the sake of lovely-haired Helen.

