# Literal translation: Pray to Nether Zeus and holy Demeter, that Demeter's holy grain may weigh heavy in full growth, when first beginning the plowing, whenever taking in hand the end of the plow-handle you bring down the goad upon the back of the oxen dragging the yoke-pin by the yoke-straps.

