# Literal translation: and thereupon drink sparkling wine, sitting in the shade, having satisfied your heart with food, turning your face toward the fresh-blowing Zephyr, and from an ever-flowing and clear-flowing spring, which is unmuddied, pour thrice of water, and pour the fourth measure of wine.

